
[l_english.IDEA_C12_PIE_FAMILY_AGREES_WITH_THE_TWO_BROTHERS_1]
Agreement with the Las Pegasus

[l_english.IDEA_C12_PIE_FAMILY_AGREES_WITH_THE_TWO_BROTHERS_1_desc]
To prevent being attacked on both fronts, we had no choice but to accept Las Pegasus’s terms, exchanging economic privileges for their neutrality in the war.

[l_simp_chinese.IDEA_C12_PIE_FAMILY_AGREES_WITH_THE_TWO_BROTHERS_1]
与洛马基的协议

[l_simp_chinese.IDEA_C12_PIE_FAMILY_AGREES_WITH_THE_TWO_BROTHERS_1_desc]
我们为了降低边境的压力，不得不答应洛马基的条件，以经济特权换取他们在战争中对我们保持中立态度
